    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900504/1009005040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009005040050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、これからアイドルになる……んですよね？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900504/1009005040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、そうだよ\r\n果穂さんはアイドルになって、色んな人を笑顔にするんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009005040060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900504/1009005040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、そのためにはもうちょっとやることがあるんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009005040070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "やることですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900504/1009005040070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう、学校にも話をしないとな\r\n仕事で休んだ時どうするとかも決めておかないといけない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな────『作戦会議』だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009005040080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "作戦会議！！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900504/1009005040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（お……\r\n……やっぱりこういう単語好きなんだな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂さんとふたりで先生にお願いしに行くことになるからな\r\n今からやってもいいか？　『作戦会議』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009005040090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
